@startuml
title SRM Approval Task - State Machine
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  ArrowColor #475569
}

[*] --> Pending
Pending --> InReview : Assigned approver opens task
Pending --> Cancelled : Request withdrawn or superseded
InReview --> Approved : Approver approves
InReview --> Rejected : Approver rejects with reason
InReview --> SentBack : Approver requests changes
InReview --> OnHold : Approver places on hold with reason
InReview --> Delegated : Authorized delegation
Delegated --> Pending : New authorized approver assigned
SentBack --> Pending : Request revised and resubmitted
(new task or controlled reactivation)
OnHold --> Pending : Hold released and task reassigned
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of InReview
Only the assigned approver or an
authorized delegate can act.
Approval authority comes from configured
approval rules and assigned limits,
not merely from an administrator role.
end note

note bottom of Approved
Approval decisions are append-only audit events.
Resubmission must preserve prior decisions,
remarks, attachments and version history.
end note
@enduml
